                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round">
                                <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/>
                                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-divider"></div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-answer">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-answer-content">
                            Our minimum order quantity starts at just 100 pieces for custom printed coffee sleeves. This allows small businesses and startups to get professional custom sleeves without breaking the bank. For larger orders (5,000+ units), we offer significant volume discounts. We also accommodate rush orders and can work with various budget requirements.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- FAQ 2 -->
            <div class="tcs-faq-item">
                <div class="tcs-faq-item-inner">
                    <div class="tcs-faq-question">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-number">02</div>
                        <div class="tcs-faq-question-text">How long does it take to receive my order?</div>
                        <div class="tcs-faq-toggle">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round">
                                <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/>
                                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-divider"></div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-answer">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-answer-content">
                            Standard production time is 7-10 business days from design approval. Shipping typically takes an additional 3-5 business days depending on your location. Rush production is available for urgent orders and can reduce turnaround time to 3-5 business days for an additional fee.
                            <div class="tcs-faq-highlight">
                                <div class="tcs-faq-highlight-title">Quick Tip:</div>
                                <div class="tcs-faq-highlight-text">Approve your design quickly to ensure faster processing. We'll send you a digital proof for approval before printing.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- FAQ 3 -->
            <div class="tcs-faq-item">
                <div class="tcs-faq-item-inner">
                    <div class="tcs-faq-question">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-number">03</div>
                        <div class="tcs-faq-question-text">Do you offer free design services?</div>
                        <div class="tcs-faq-toggle">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round">
                                <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/>
                                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-divider"></div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-answer">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-answer-content">
                            Yes! We provide complimentary design services with every order. Our experienced design team will work with you to create the perfect artwork for your coffee sleeves. Simply provide us with your logo, brand colors, and any specific design requirements, and we'll create a professional design at no extra cost. You'll receive a digital proof for approval before production begins.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- FAQ 4 -->
