                                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-divider"></div>
                    <div class="tcs-faq-answer">
                        <div class="tcs-faq-answer-content">
                            Pricing varies based on quantity, material, printing complexity, and finishing options, and larger quantities receive volume discounts. Contact us for a detailed quote based on your specific requirements. All quotes include free design services.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- FAQ 10 -->
